          %h3#reflection_into_prespectrum_objects Reflection into pre-spectrum objects
          %p
            For
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi 𝒞
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{C}
            an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-category"} (∞,1)-category
            with
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-pullbacks"} (∞,1)-pullbacks
            and
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-colimits"} (∞,1)-colimits
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/exact+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-functor"} left exact
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/reflective+sub-%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-category"} reflective sub-(∞,1)-category
            inclusion (
            %a{:href => "#Joyal08"}> Joyal 08, section 35
            ).
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Spec
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi 𝒞
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mover
                    %mo ↪
                    %mover
                      %mo ←
                      %mi lex
                  %mi PreSpec
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi 𝒞
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                  %mo .
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                  Spec(\mathcal{C})
                  \\stackrel{\overset{lex}{\leftarrow}}{\hookrightarrow}
                  PreSpec(\mathcal{C})
                  \\,.
          %p
            This implies in particular that the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tangent+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-category"} tangent (∞,1)-category
            of an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-topos"} (∞,1)-topos
            is itself again an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-topos"} (∞,1)-topos
            (
            %a{:href => "#Joyal08"}> Joyal 08, section 35.5
            ), see at
            %em
              %a{:href => "tangent+%28infinity%2C1%29-category#TangentTopos"} tangent (∞,1)-category – Tangent (∞,1)-topos
            \.
