                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cospectrum"} cospectrum
          %h2#references References
          %p
            Discussion in terms of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stable+%28infinity%2C1%29-categories"} stable (infinity,1)-categories
            is in
          %ul
            %li#StabCat
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacob+Lurie"}> Jacob Lurie
                , section 8 of
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stable+Infinity-Categories"} Stable Infinity-Categories
            %li#HigherAlg
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacob+Lurie"}> Jacob Lurie
                , section 1.4.2
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Higher+Algebra"} Higher Algebra
            %li#Joyal08
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andr%C3%A9+Joyal"}> André Joyal
                , section 35
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Notes on Logoi
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.math.uchicago.edu/~may/IMA/JOYAL/Joyal.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            Discussion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+structure+on+spectra"} model structures for spectrum objects
            includes
          %ul
            %li#Hovey00
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mark+Hovey"}> Mark Hovey
                ,
                %em Spectra and symmetric spectra in general model categories
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0004051"}> arXiv:0004051
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bj%C3%B8rn+Ian+Dundas"}> Bjørn Ian Dundas
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Oliver+R%C3%B6ndigs"} Oliver Röndigs
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Arne+%C3%98stv%C3%A6r"} Paul Arne Østvær
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Enriched functors and stable homotopy theory
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://eudml.org/doc/123650"} EuDML
          %p A detailed treatment of the 1-categorical case is in the last chapter of
          %ul
            %li#Ayoub
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Joseph+Ayoub"}> Joseph Ayoub
              ,
              = succeed "." do
                %em Les six opérations de Grothendieck et le formalisme des cycles évanescents dans le monde motivique, I
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://user.math.uzh.ch/ayoub/PDF-Files/THESE.PDF"} pdf
          %p
            Generalization to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G-spectra"} G-spectra
            is in
          %ul
            %li#Blumberg05
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andrew+Blumberg"}> Andrew Blumberg
              ,
              %em Continuous functors as a model for the equivariant stable homotopy category
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math.AT/0505512"}> arXiv:math.AT/0505512
              )
